cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and credit the Wiktionary contributors (CC BY-SA 4.0)."
title: "Ferhenga Pirzimanî – Kurdish Multilingual Lexicon: dictionary, reference grammar and etymology (Kurmanji, Sorani, Southern Kurdish, Zazaki, Gorani ↔ Turkish, English, German)"
abstract: "Open lexical database of Kurdish varieties derived from Wiktionary, with UPOS, gender, UD and UniMorph morphological features, inflected forms, rule-generated verb paradigms, etymology classes, translations into Turkish, English and German, a CLDF Dictionary export, and a descriptive reference grammar of Kurmanji (in Turkish) with Leipzig-glossed examples. Evaluated against UniMorph and the UD Kurmanji treebank. Not yet expert-reviewed."
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
